    <description>Fires whenever a Custom Product Request is created or updated to Status__c = &apos;Approved&apos; (by the &quot;Product Finalized (Quote Accepted)&quot; button, or any other path that sets this status) and requests the N-Genius deposit payment link (Link 1) for it. Runs after-save per CARADepositBasketQueueable&apos;s own requirement: Apex forbids a callout in the same transaction as pending DML, so this must enqueue the Queueable only after the triggering save has committed.</description>
    <interviewLabel>CPR Approved - Create Deposit Basket {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
